{"id":"adecuado","lemma":"adecuado","pos":"adj","rank":1761,"glosses":["adequate","appropriate, suitable"],"ipa":"/adeˈkwado/","forms":{"feminine":"adecuada","masculinePlural":"adecuados","femininePlural":"adecuadas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b1/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-adecuado.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Eso es adecuado?","en":"Is that suitable?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442800","words":[null,null,null],"phrases":[[0,2,"that's it"]]},{"text":"No creo que sea la adecuada para el trabajo.","en":"I don't think she is fit for the job.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/608943","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"work, job"}]},{"text":"Él es el hombre adecuado para el puesto.","en":"He is the right man for the post.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/684510","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"man"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"put"}]},{"text":"Estaba esperando el momento adecuado.","en":"I was waiting for the right moment.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594842","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to hope","l":"esperar"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"moment, instant"},null]},{"text":"No quiero hacerlo sin las herramientas adecuadas.","en":"I don't want to do that without the proper tools.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594948","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"without"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"a tool, an implement","l":"herramienta"},null]}]}